只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"another version of deepseek herness trajectory (DIY)","id":"gh:1334365870","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"DSH-Plan-Graph","slug":"HR2AY/DSH-Plan-Graph","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","thread","trajectory","visualization"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"another version of deepseek herness trajectory (DIY)"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-plan-graph"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"An out-of-tree DeepSeek Harness plugin bundle: an interactive flow graph of a session's tool calls a"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"nd messages, rendered client-side from the conversation snapshot. The plugin adds a \"Plan Graph\" tab"},{"id":"p3s3","text":" to the session view ring (pan/zoom canvas, status-colored node cards, node details, hide-tool-calls"},{"id":"p3s4","text":" and group-by-turn toggles, follow latest, and \"Merge into conversation\" into the real right sidebar"},{"id":"p3s5","text":"nd group-by-turn toggles, follow latest, and \"Merge into conversation\" into the real right sidebar)."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"pkg-3 adds three features on top of the graph:"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"- **Favorites** — a panel centered at the bottom of the view, opened from the toolbar button (colore"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"d kind tiles + summary + time). Per-session, persisted as JSON in `localStorage` under `dsh.plan-gra"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"ph.fav.<sessionId>`, deduped by node id, capped at 100. Add via the node context menu or by dragging"},{"id":"p5s4","text":" a node onto the toolbar favorites button. Click an entry to center the graph on that node with a fl"},{"id":"p5s5","text":"ash highlight; if the node has left the current window (partial finished, node paged out), the click"},{"id":"p5s6","text":" falls back to the matching chat row by seq/callId. Removal goes through the node context menu.\n- **"},{"id":"p5s7","text":"Node context menu** — right-click a node for: add/remove favorite, locate in conversation (tool-call"},{"id":"p5s8","text":" nodes only), copy node info, view details. Closes on outside click, Escape, or canvas interaction. "},{"id":"p5s9","text":"Favorites are managed here (and by dragging a node onto the toolbar favorites button) — there is no "},{"id":"p5s10","text":"★ button on the details panel.\n- **Locate in conversation** — maps any node to its chat row: tool ca"},{"id":"p5s11","text":"lls by `callId`, assistant output by `data.finalNode.seq`, and user input / steering / context by `d"},{"id":"p5s12","text":"ata.seq` (the same event seq the graph node id embeds), then waits for the `data-chat-flow-key` anch"},{"id":"p5s13","text":"or via `MutationObserver`, scrolls it into view and flashes it; a 10s timeout silently falls back to"},{"id":"p5s14","text":" in-graph locate. Prefers an upstream `chatLocate` optional service when a deployment provides one."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"The browser half is the plan-graph dynamic-plugin code (pkg-3), wrapped in the web module loader's h"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"andoff format — plain JavaScript, no build-time dependencies. The `prepare` script (which pnpm runs "},{"id":"p6s3","text":"after a git install) regenerates `client.js` from `client.body.js`."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Changes since 0.1.0 (pkg-20): pkg-21 — user/steering nodes display「输入」(input) and context nodes「已完成」"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"(completed) instead of idle; pkg-22 — dragging the canvas no longer selects text (`user-select: none"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"` + `preventDefault` on mousedown); pkg-3 — favorites (persisted, drag-to-add), node context menu, a"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"nd locate-in-chat; pkg-4 — the graph flash highlight clears itself via the CSS animation's `animatio"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"nend` (the dynamic client half withholds browser timer globals, so `setTimeout` is not used); pkg-5 "},{"id":"p7s6","text":"— favorites UI is the dropdown-panel form (colored kind tiles + summary + locate pin + details ★ but"},{"id":"p7s7","text":"ton); pkg-6 — the panel renders centered at the bottom of the view and the per-entry × remove button"},{"id":"p7s8","text":" is dropped; pkg-7 — the context menu reorders so 定位至对话区 (locate-in-chat) sits below the favorites t"},{"id":"p7s9","text":"oggle; pkg-8 — the `chatNodeVisibility` service gains `subscribe(fn)` (its consumer calls it during "},{"id":"p7s10","text":"Chat render; without it the conversation page went blank when switching back to Chat); pkg-9 — 定位到图内"},{"id":"p7s11","text":" removed from the context menu, the details ★ button removed (favorites via context menu only), and "},{"id":"p7s12","text":"favorites entries store the node seq with a chat-row fallback when the node leaves the window; pkg-1"},{"id":"p7s13","text":"es entries store the node seq with a chat-row fallback when the node leaves the window; pkg-1 [长行截断]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"From a directory that contains this package (or any npm registry / tarball / git host):"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"- **From GitHub** (sources, not built artifacts — the `prepare` script builds on install): `dsh plug"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"in --profile demo add github:<you>/plan-graph-bundle#<sha>`. pnpm refuses to run the `prepare` scrip"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"t until it is allowlisted — copy the exact package key pnpm printed into the profile's `pnpm-workspa"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"t is allowlisted — copy the exact package key pnpm printed into the profile's `pnpm-workspace.yaml`:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"and re-run the `add`. That allowance is permission to execute this package's code on your machine at"},{"id":"p13s2","text":" install time — pin a commit (`#<sha>`) and only install sources you trust.\n- **From a tarball** (no"},{"id":"p13s3","text":" build permission needed): `pnpm pack` in this directory, then `dsh plugin --profile demo add ./dsh-"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"plan-graph-0.3.0.tgz`.\n- **From npm** (once published): `dsh plugin --profile demo add dsh-plan-grap"},{"id":"p13s5","text":"n-graph-0.3.0.tgz`.\n- **From npm** (once published): `dsh plugin --profile demo add dsh-plan-graph`."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Verify the layer without booting: `dsh --profile demo --dump-config` shows a `# == dsh-plan-graph` l"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"y the layer without booting: `dsh --profile demo --dump-config` shows a `# == dsh-plan-graph` layer."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## What it needs"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"- The browser half registers into `conversation.view` / `details` through the standard client plugin"},{"id":"p16s2","text":" services (`slots`, `locale`, `layout`), all provided by the dsh web surface.\n- \"Hide tool calls\" pr"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"ovides the optional `chatNodeVisibility` service. The shipped ui-conversation does not consume it ye"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"t, so against an unpatched dsh the toggle hides nothing on the chat page (the graph itself honors it"},{"id":"p16s5","text":"); deployments with a ui-conversation that consumes the service get the live chat filtering.\n- Fresh"},{"id":"p16s6","text":" sessions keep Chat as the default view; the Plan Graph tab is one click away. A deployment that wan"},{"id":"p16s7","text":"ts the graph front and center provides the upstream `conversationDefaultView` service itself (`{ id:"},{"id":"p16s8","text":" 'plan-graph' }`).\n- \"Locate in conversation\" reads the shared conversation snapshot and targets the"},{"id":"p16s9","text":" chat row's `data-chat-flow-key` anchor. The anchor is a view-layer contract of the shipped chat vie"},{"id":"p16s10","text":"w; if a future dsh renames it, the feature silently falls back to in-graph locate rather than errori"},{"id":"p16s11","text":"if a future dsh renames it, the feature silently falls back to in-graph locate rather than erroring."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Regenerating the client bundle"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"`npm run prepare` (or `node scripts/build-client.mjs`) rewrites `client.js` from `client.body.js`. E"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"dit the body, never the generated file."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
